# Lofoten, from Lofotodden and Å to Austvågøya and Svolvær. No official
# boundary, so a box around those places (Kartverket's place names). Mostly
# sea: Kartverket sends those tiles empty, so they cost next to nothing.
# EPSG:25833 metres, on the 2 km tile grid (1645 tiles).
WEST=406000
SOUTH=7522000
EAST=500000
NORTH=7592000
# N50 county files covering the box (Kartverket names), for the no-go areas.
N50_COUNTIES="18_Nordland"
